Files derived from mem0:

- lib/mem0-prompts.js: ADDITIVE_EXTRACTION_PROMPT, AGENT_CONTEXT_SUFFIX and the
  language requirement of generate_additive_extraction_prompt, copied verbatim
  from mem0/configs/prompts.py (unmodified).
- lib/extraction.js: JavaScript port of generate_additive_extraction_prompt and
  its helpers (mem0/configs/prompts.py) and of parse_messages,
  remove_code_blocks and extract_json (mem0/memory/utils.py). Modified: the
  language requirement is always on (use_input_language=True), and the reason
  an unusable answer failed is reported.
- lib/native-client.js and lib/store-sqlite.js: JavaScript port of the V3
  additive add pipeline and the search of mem0/memory/main.py (session scope,
  last 10 messages, top 10 similar memories, md5 deduplication, ADD only;
  search candidates and threshold). Modified: SQLite instead of a vector
  database, no BM25 or entity boosts, adds of one scope run one at a time, and
  the turn is not remembered when the extraction will be retried.
- test/fixtures/mem0-2.2.1-extraction.json: output of mem0 2.2.1's own helper
  functions, produced by scripts/mem0-extraction-fixture.py.

